--- META ---
name: anyOf header matching - request without headers
summary: The same task_id without x-env/x-role falls through to the header-less stub
tags: [anyOf, headers]

--- ENDPOINT ---
tasktracker.TaskService/GetTask

--- REQUEST ---
{
  "task_id": "admin-task"
}

--- RESPONSE ---
{
  "ok": false,
  "priority": "low",
  "status": "restricted",
  "task_id": "admin-task",
  "title": "Admin Task (no header)"
}
